  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-TVKGJzio\" id=\"h346b9f0-XlguUb6C\">选择器 <span style=\"color: #000000;\">AgentCostReportSelector</span></h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-c0EHf8nc\">查询代理商消耗报表，对应方舟平台侧「<strong>商务-流水查询-消耗报表</strong>」数据。支持AD、千川业务线。</p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-TFRG2vZT\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-GEOscuGA\">方法</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" class=\"data-table\" data-id=\"t75ae23f-RRGeTbjO\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-INROIc8R\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c1d5144c-QQdh6kRI\" width=\"17.064846416382252%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c86e1a47-JElEdH69\" width=\"48.009101251422074%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c720f8cf-da38IDPD\" width=\"34.92605233219568%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-4KGbmBJ4\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-Fdi9a6V9\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-V6DCUSm6\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JaVE7UhN\"><strong>名称</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-74PJCULZ\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OeC8PW1Y\"><strong>类型</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-bdMCAAiR\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1IA8mJYQ\"><strong>描述</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-XRZ0XXQf\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-IeJ4lME3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dchhALcp\">withAgentId</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-aomlbU7U\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-U0JgeYmo\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">(agent_id) =&gt; this</code></p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-UN1KFSkP\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-beMhY5jP\">指定要查询的 agent_id（必填项）</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-4U8OWXP9\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-OIPC2X3m\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Mf4bYlqO\">withFiltering</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-cQKgLOlP\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-g8QYarGS\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">(filtering: AgentCostSelectArgumentsFiltering) =&gt; this</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t00cbcc2-h6BIGKFE\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bKY0T1dk\">指定 filtering，取值参考&nbsp;<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1784978302450756\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">代理商消耗报表 - 请求参数</a>&nbsp;filtering字段</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-Ugcdf2Vg\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t882b249-M8ioZ5o6\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gsS47cH8\">withDate</p></td><td data-id=\"t882b249-SAMmW63G\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-452sgj3N\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">(start_date: string, end_date: string) =&gt; this</code></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t7e901cd-cMgRT2dD\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lLb9o0ZU\">指定查询的开始日期start_date与结束日期end_date（必填项）。格式为：YYYY-MM- DD，例如2022-08-01。可选日期范围是今天以前，开始与结束时间的跨度不能超过180天。</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"tcd2aa35-CJXiYSZc\" style=\"height: 60px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-12eYhRUi\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-60Pq2WrN\">withOrderBy</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-DnJkl2X8\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hy7uSdLx\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">(order_field: keyof AgentCostResponseListItem, order_type?: 'DESC' | 'ASC') =&gt; this</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t00cbcc2-nlHSbFfL\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XAvVmXBA\">指定报表内容的排序方式。order_field排序依据字段，取值参考&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1784978302450756\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">代理商消耗报表 - 应答字段</a>&nbsp;list下的字段，order_type排序方式（DESC降序、ASC升序）</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-aKYlXPWW\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-VfGMkiF8\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-U5aDHLZA\">filterMetrics</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-Ym7JOrfn\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Tsupknlz\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">(resFiltering: Array&lt;keyof AgentCostResponseListItem&gt;) =&gt; this</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t00cbcc2-1VBUVM45\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TDXLI3Oq\">指定需要保留的响应字段，取值参考&nbsp;<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1784978302450756\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">代理商消耗报表 - 应答字段</a>&nbsp;list下的字段。</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-VbFhDo2M\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-HNNgoNMQ\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JECyNsR4\">getCostReport</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-m7HnEP4S\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-35ilOvyN\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">() =&gt; Promise&lt;AgentCostResponseListItem[]&gt;</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t00cbcc2-X77FEQ1W\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wIosAIWz\">用上面构建好的请求参数，获取代理商消耗报表，调用 MAPI 接口：&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1784978302450756\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">代理商消耗报表</a></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-U0D2mM9V\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-E0OUfTlj\">直接返回代理商消耗报表数组，上限为100条</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-Ij3UXbmr\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t882b249-qfUpLkpO\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uSlkKi3N\">forEachAsyncParallel</p></td><td data-id=\"t882b249-1eqZjvXK\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7ZtiY348\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">(callbackFn) =&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t7e901cd-9S82S5jm\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fEo1x3E3\">用上面构建好的请求参数，获取代理商消耗报表，调用 MAPI 接口：<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1784978302450756\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">代理商消耗报表</a></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-LW94ZMT9\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-EICdnVRU\">对每一页返回的 ReportRow 报表行异步并行执行 callbackFn。如果需要提前终止循环，可以 <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">throw new Mapi.ShouldBreakError()</code></li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-QpceOZBr\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-wHBscx8n\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wmbbk65f\">iterator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-yhYfNJQJ\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5B4ZxwNa\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">() =&gt; AsyncIterable&lt;AgentCostResponseListItem&gt;</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t00cbcc2-aVc76c4M\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-K0V7CKRV\">用上面构建好的请求参数，获取代理商消耗报表，调用 MAPI 接口：<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1741387668314126\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">代理商消耗报表</a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-5TObcDOh\">需通过 for await of 遍历</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-n2Xfdne8\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-al7lSDkD\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-imONKxxX\">count</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-Zn94VNDB\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ze3MHjmJ\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">() =&gt; Promise&lt;number&gt;</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t5bc59a3-G4ALfH2l\" class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kwiaUwNI\">用上面构建好的请求参数，获取代理商消耗报表，</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-wUGzAjBI\">返回数据总条数</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-nk3i8QYi\"><br></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-Qy0zXgTH\" id=\"h490b8bf-JDWUR5Vy\">代码示例</h2><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3%5Cnexport%20async%20function%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20const%20yesterdayDate%20%3D%20getYesterdayDate()%3B%5Cn%20%20const%20agents%20%3D%20await%20Mapi.getAgents()%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20for%20(const%20agent%20of%20agents)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E6%8A%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E8%BF%AD%E4%BB%A3%E5%99%A8%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20costReports%20%3D%20agent%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20.costReportSelector()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20.withDate(yesterdayDate%2C%20yesterdayDate)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20.iterator()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%81%8D%E5%8E%86%E6%8A%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20await%20(const%20data%20of%20costReports)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20console.log(data)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20return%20%5C%22ok%5C%22%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E6%98%A8%E5%A4%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%5Cnfunction%20getYesterdayDate()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20return%20Utils.dayjs().subtract(1%2C%20%5C%22day%5C%22).format(%5C%22YYYY-MM-DD%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22disabled%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22itSGb%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content javascript\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-WaBsJHhp\">完整案例见：<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/openapi/docs?docLibId=1781346820953290&amp;docId=1798372718377075&amp;identifyKey=4c52d27f2feb70dd5cb26002b7f490c9d6e562c6054739a0a30849fefd5460d4\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">代理商消耗报表查询</a></p></div>",
